@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Device CRUD Operations (Module 4 Patterns)

participant "Client (Engineer)" as Client
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "device-service" as Service
participant "Keycloak" as Auth
participant "Redis" as Cache
participant "Kafka" as Broker
participant "device-collector" as Collector
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Grafana Alloy" as Alloy

== Создание устройства (POST /devices) ==
Client -> Gateway: POST /devices {data} + Auth: Bearer <JWT>
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Gateway: Генерация X-Request-ID: <trace-id>
Gateway -> Auth: Валидация токена
Auth --> Gateway: Valid
Gateway -> Service: Forward Request\n[Headers: X-Request-ID=<trace-id>, Authorization=Bearer...]
activate Service

Service -> Service: Security Filter (JWT Verification)
Service -> Service: Logging Aspect (MDC Put Trace-ID)
Service -> Cache: GET idempotency:<Idempotency-Key>
activate Cache
alt Ключ найден
    Cache --> Service: Возврат сохраненного ответа
    Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (Результат из кэша)
else Ключ не найден
    Service -> Service: Валидация DTO (JSR-380 @Valid)

    alt Ошибка валидации
        Service --> Gateway: 400 Bad Request (RFC 7807)
    else Валидно
        Service -> Broker: Produce Command (device-create)
        activate Broker
        Broker --> Service: Ack
        deactivate Broker

        Service -> Cache: SET idempotency:<key> (TTL)
        Cache --> Service: OK
        deactivate Cache

        Service -> Service: Логирование аудита (JSON)
        Service --> Gateway: 202 Accepted (или 201 с Location)
    end
end
deactivate Service
Gateway --> Client: Response + X-Request-ID: <trace-id>
deactivate Gateway

par Сбор метрик (Background)
    Service -> Alloy: Push: метрики (Micrometer), логи (stdout), трейсы (OTLP)
end

par Асинхронная обработка (device-collector)
    Broker -> Collector: Consume: device-create
    activate Collector
    Collector -> DB: INSERT/UPSERT (ShardingSphere-JDBC)
    activate DB
    DB --> Collector: Success
    deactivate DB
    Collector -> Broker: Produce Event device-created {device_id, status}
    deactivate Collector
end

== Получение устройства (GET /devices/{id}) ==
Client -> Gateway: GET /devices/{id} + Auth: Bearer <JWT>
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Auth: Валидация JWT
Auth --> Gateway: Valid
Gateway -> Service: Forward + X-Request-ID=<trace-id>, Authorization=Bearer...
activate Service

Service -> Service: Security Filter (JWT Verification, опционально для GET)
Service -> Cache: GET device:{id}
activate Cache
alt Cache Hit
    Cache --> Service: DTO
    Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (DTO)
else Cache Miss
    Service -> DB: SELECT device_id=? (Read via ShardingSphere)
    activate DB
    DB --> Service: Entity
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: Map Entity -> DTO (MapStruct)
    Service -> Cache: SET device:{id} DTO (TTL)
    Cache --> Service: OK
    Service --> Gateway: 200 OK (DTO)
end
deactivate Service
deactivate Cache
Gateway --> Client: JSON Response + X-Request-ID: <trace-id>
deactivate Gateway

note right: Alloy агрегирует метрики (latency, error_rate)\nи логи с trace-id для Grafana/Loki
@enduml